WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.010
Traditional Chinese culture, with its long history and great variety, is a treasure that every young person should get to know.
中华传统文化历史悠久、丰富多彩，是每个年轻人都应该了解的瑰宝。

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:20.370
However, many college students today are more familiar with foreign movies and online games than with classical poetry or traditional festivals.
然而，如今许多大学生对外国电影和网络游戏比对古典诗词或传统节日更熟悉。

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:25.710
It is therefore worth considering how to enrich their knowledge of their own culture.
因此，值得思考如何丰富他们对本国文化的了解。

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:37.250
First, universities can offer elective courses in subjects such as calligraphy, Chinese painting and classical literature, taught in engaging ways rather than through lectures alone.
第一，大学可以开设书法、国画、古典文学等科目的选修课，并用生动有趣的方式讲授，而不只是单纯讲课。

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.480
Second, student clubs can organize hands-on activities.
第二，学生社团可以组织动手实践活动。

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:50.550
For example, students can make rice dumplings together before the Dragon Boat Festival or learn traditional crafts like paper cutting.
例如，学生们可以在端午节前一起包粽子，或者学习剪纸等传统手艺。

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:56.250
Such experiences make culture something to enjoy rather than something to memorize.
这样的体验让文化成为可以享受的东西，而不是需要死记硬背的东西。

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:04.700
Third, students themselves should take the initiative to read classic works and visit museums and historical sites in their spare time.
第三，学生自己应该在课余时间主动阅读经典著作，参观博物馆和名胜古迹。

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:11.420
When knowledge is combined with personal experience, traditional culture will no longer seem distant.
当知识与亲身体验相结合时，传统文化就不再显得遥远。

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:17.880
Instead, it will become part of students’ daily lives and a source of pride that they carry into the future.
相反，它会成为学生日常生活的一部分，成为他们带向未来的自豪之源。
